msgid "Reads which end Process_BeanOpen reached. `claimed`: the bean is in progress and this process works it. `not yours`: a sibling session or a human holds it, nothing was written to it, and this process stops here rather than work a bean it does not own (bean-coordination)."
msgstr ""

#: ../folio-assistant-core/processes/library/l1-document-ingestion.bpmn:188
#. Diagram label
msgid "Record the gap as a bean"
msgstr ""

#: ../folio-assistant-core/processes/library/l1-document-ingestion.bpmn:44
#. Diagram element documentation
msgid "Runs the whole pipeline from CallActivity_Basic through Task_Promote, and then Task_SummaryQueue, where it drains a few prose blocks of the advisory summary queue — including the theme branch, which stays in THIS lane rather than dipping into Lane_2: deciding a document is a theme source is the engine asking its author a question, not a write to the shared work plan. It does not stop at a gap: Gateway_Complete's 'gap' branch leaves this lane only for Lane_2 to record the bean, then Flow_i8 returns here at CallActivity_Derive, until Gateway_Complete says complete."
msgstr ""

